    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a \"gap\" though. it feels like a ceiling. i've always been the one people could count on, the one who always wins. and now that i've failed, there's nothing left to go back to. if i keep going like this, i'm just gonna keep failing and watching them get older and more disappointed by me every single day. it's like the more i try to fix it, the more i just prove how much i've lost. i'd rather they just remember me as the person who actually made it, instead of watching me slowly fall apart.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
