      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your parents' love was never conditional on your success, and their disappointment is a reflection of their own fear, not your failure. The ceiling you see is just the weight of your own expectations, not a limit on your potential. You are not falling apart; you are simply realizing that the path you walked was never the only one, and you are allowed to choose a different direction.",
